' Change 1662: #option StartupMethodsDisabled, and the program calls InitSys itself.
' Expected (build 1662): ";!  call INITSYS" at the start, then the program's own "call INITSYS": the INITSYS routine
' is compiled because the program calls it. INITRANDOM is not compiled (not called).
#chip 18F46J50, 48
#option explicit
#option StartupMethodsDisabled

InitSys
Dir PORTB Out
Do
    PORTB = PORTB + 1
    Wait 100 ms
Loop
